msgstr "不在本次粘贴中"

#: templates/eos_sig_checker/index.html:195
#, python-format
msgid "Nothing known in %(system)s yet. Paste the probe scanner on the left."
msgstr "%(system)s 中尚无已知信号。请在左侧粘贴 Probe Scanner 内容。"

#: templates/eos_sig_checker/index.html:199
msgid ""
"Paste the probe scanner on the left and press Check: every line comes back "
"here, with group and name filled in where somebody has scanned it already."
msgstr "将 Probe Scanner 内容粘贴到左侧并点击检查：每一行都会显示在这里，已有人扫描过的会补全分组和名称。"

#: templates/eos_sig_checker/index.html:205
