#: tracking.py:97
msgid ""
"This character cannot be tracked: it is not yours or has no token with the "
"location scope."
msgstr "无法追踪此角色：它不属于你，或没有带位置权限范围的令牌。"

#: tracking.py:119
msgid ""
"The token of this character is no longer valid. Add the character again with"
" the location scope."
msgstr "此角色的令牌已失效。请使用位置权限范围重新添加该角色。"

#: tracking.py:126
msgid "The location could not be read from ESI. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "无法从 ESI 读取位置。请稍后再试。"

#: views.py:107
